OL,3,CThe true cost of being underinsured:
OL,4,CFamily left with bill for thousands
OL,6,FHomeowners in Jersey and Guernsey are
OL,7,Fbeing warned their properties may be
OL,8,Funderinsured, which could end up
OL,9,Fcosting them thousands of pounds.
OL,11,FLocal brokers say many of their
OL,12,Fclients are not properly covered for
OL,13,Fdamage to their homes, as inflation
OL,14,Frates continue to rise, and with the
OL,15,Fcost of construction in the Bailiwicks
OL,16,Fsignificantly higher than in the UK.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
