OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1786996104
OL,3,CThe true cost of being underinsured:
OL,4,CFamily left with bill for thousands
OL,6,FNaomi Bonett's Jersey home was
OL,7,Fdestroyed by an electrical fire in
OL,8,FMay. Despite having a comprehensive
OL,9,Finsurance policy, when she went to
OL,10,Fmake a claim she discovered she would
OL,11,Freceive less than half of the money
OL,12,Fshe needed to rebuild.
OL,14,FSpeaking to ITV Channel, Naomi said,
OL,15,F"The underwriters contacted me and
OL,16,Fsaid that there was concern in regards
OL,17,Fto my property being undervalued. I
OL,18,Fdidn't really understand what they
OL,19,Fwere saying, there was no question
OL,20,Fover what I'd paid or how much I'd
OL,21,Fvalued the property for a rebuild.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,353,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1786996104
OL,3,CThe true cost of being underinsured:
OL,4,CFamily left with bill for thousands
OL,6,F"After a surveyor came around the
OL,7,Finsurance company is now saying that
OL,8,FI've undervalued my property by 53%."
OL,10,FIt means that Naomi's insurer will
OL,11,Fonly cover 47% of the cost. She added,
OL,12,F"It has caused me an extreme amount of
OL,13,Fstress and upset and I also question
OL,14,Fwhere I'm going to find this money
OL,15,Ffrom."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
