OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1786996104
OL,3,CThe true cost of being underinsured:
OL,4,CFamily left with bill for thousands
OL,6,FBuilding surveyor Clare Richmond told
OL,7,FITV Channel that many people do not
OL,8,Fknow about the important difference
OL,9,Fbetween the value of a property and
OL,10,Frebuild costs, which is what you
OL,11,Factually have to insure it for in
OL,12,Forder for costs to be covered if there
OL,13,Fis damage.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
