PN,35206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1786996104
OL,3,CThe true cost of being underinsured:
OL,4,CFamily left with bill for thousands
OL,6,FShe explains, "So your house value is
OL,7,Fa value of the market value of your
OL,8,Fproperty at that stage in time. Your
OL,9,Frebuild value is how much is it going
OL,10,Fto cost if your house fell down, or
OL,11,Fburnt down in a fire, to rebuild your
OL,12,Fhouse and the associated costs
OL,13,Finvolved in that.
OL,15,F"A lot of people just think, 'Well my
OL,16,Fhouse is worth #600,000, I'll just put
OL,17,Fit down as #600,000'. But actually
OL,18,Fthere's a lot more to it."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
