PN,35207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F352A1786996104
OL,3,CThe true cost of being underinsured:
OL,4,CFamily left with bill for thousands
OL,6,FLocal insurance brokers say it is a
OL,7,Fproblem they are encountering more and
OL,8,Fmore frequently. However, they insist
OL,9,Fit is the consumer's responsibility to
OL,10,Fcheck their homes are valued properly.
OL,12,FInsurance broker Simon Rodrick told
OL,13,FITV Channel, "The underinsurance or
OL,14,Funder valuing of items is purely down
OL,15,Fto ignorance - or there's an element
OL,16,Fof complacency about it. We expect the
OL,17,Finsurance policy to cover everything,
OL,18,Fbut there is an onus of importance on
OL,19,Fthe insured to make sure those figures
OL,20,Fare actually correct."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/7
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
